  A.blank("b2-q23", "Medium", "Depth-3 binary tree A..O (A's children B, C; B: D, E; D: H, I; E: J, K; C: F, G; F: L, M; G: N, O). Goal G. DFS expansion order (left child first) until G is expanded:", "A, B, D, H, I, E, J, K, C, F, L, M, G", ["ABDHIEJKCFLMG"], "DFS dives to the bottom of the left subtree first.", P(23, "search-bfs-dfs"));
